{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misolistitemdata"]}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOListItemData","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"text":"Represents the main content displayed within a list item component such as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOStaticListItem","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISONavigationListItem","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOListItemData"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/Navigations"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOListItemData","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" groups all the text-based information that a list item can display:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a mandatory label (either a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"String"},{"type":"text","text":" or a custom "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"View"},{"type":"text","text":"), and optional description, overline,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"extra label, and helper text, and slots."}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Code samples","anchor":"Code-samples"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["    \/\/ Minimal: label only (String)","    let data = MISOListItemData(label: \"Label\")","","    \/\/ Label with bold style","    let data = MISOListItemData(label: \"Label\", hasBoldLabel: true)","","    \/\/ Custom view as label with accessibility label","    let data = MISOListItemData(","        label: HStack {","            Image(systemName: \"star.fill\")","            Text(\"Custom Label\")","        },","        accessibilityLabel: \"Favorite Custom Label\"","    )","","    \/\/ Full content with text label","    let data = MISOListItemData(","        label: \"Label\",","        hasBoldLabel: false,","        description: \"Description\",","        overline: \"Overline\",","        extraLabel: \"Extra Label\",","        helperText: \"Helper text providing guidance\"","    )","","    \/\/ Full content with custom view label","    let data = MISOListItemData(","        label: VStack(alignment: .leading) {","            Text(\"Title\").font(.headline)","            Text(\"Subtitle\").font(.caption)","        },","        accessibilityLabel: \"Title, Subtitle\",","        description: \"Description\",","        overline: \"Overline\",","        extraLabel: \"Extra Label\",","        helperText: \"Helper text providing guidance\"","    )","","    \/\/ Overline as a user-styled rich text (AttributedString)","    \/\/ Same \"overline\" parameter name as the String variant, disambiguated by the value's type.","    let data = MISOListItemData(","        label: \"Label\",","        overline: .from(text: \"Overline\",","                        foregroundColor: theme.colors.contentBrandPrimary.color(for: colorScheme),","                        font: someFont)","    )","","    \/\/ Usage with a static list item","    MISOStaticListItem(data: data)","","    \/\/ Usage with a navigation list item","    MISONavigationListItem(data: data) {","        \/\/ Navigate to next screen","    }","","    \/\/ With slot (displayed under texts, before helper text)","    let dataWithSlot = MISOListItemData(","        label: \"Label\",","        textSlot: MISOListItemData.Slot { Text(\"Additional content\") },","        helperText: \"Helper text\"","    )","","    \/\/ With text slot and bottom slot (bottom slot displayed under text slot, before helper text)","    let dataWithBothSlots = MISOListItemData(","        label: \"Label\",","        textSlot: MISOListItemData.Slot { Text(\"Slot content\") },","        bottomSlot: MISOListItemData.Slot { Text(\"Bottom content\") },","        helperText: \"Helper text\"","    )"]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Custom view label","anchor":"Custom-view-label"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When providing a custom view as label:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"hasBoldLabel"},{"type":"text","text":" property is not applicable; all styling is controlled by the provided view."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"You must provide an ","type":"text"},{"code":"accessibilityLabel","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" parameter so that Voice Over can vocalize the label.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"This ","type":"text"},{"code":"accessibilityLabel","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is used in the combined accessibility label of the list item text container.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"You must also check the accessibility of your custom views (navigation with switch control and full keyboard access, dynamic types, contrast ratios)","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Small size behavior","anchor":"Small-size-behavior"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"When the list item is displayed in small size (via the ","type":"text"},{"code":".misoListItemSize(.small)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" modifier),","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"overline"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"extraLabel"},{"type":"text","text":" properties are "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"automatically hidden"}]},{"type":"text","text":" to ensure a compact layout."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Only the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"label"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"description"},{"type":"text","text":", and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"helperText"},{"type":"text","text":" remain visible."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"code":"bottomSlot","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is also "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"automatically hidden"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":", but the "},{"code":"textSlot","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" remains displayed."}]},{"syntax":"swift","code":["    \/\/ overline, extraLabel and bottomSlot will not be displayed","    MISOStaticListItem(data: MISOListItemData(","        label: \"Label\",","        overline: \"Hidden in small\",","        extraLabel: \"Also hidden in small\"","    ))","    .misoListItemSize(.small)"],"type":"codeListing"},{"name":"Since","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS 3.0.0"}]}],"style":"note","type":"aside"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents"]]},"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","symbolKind":"struct","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MISOListItemData","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"MISOListItemData","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MISOListItemData","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"s:14MISOComponents16MISOListItemDataV","platforms":[{"beta":false,"introducedAt":"15.0","name":"iOS","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false},{"beta":false,"introducedAt":"13.0","name":"macOS","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false},{"beta":false,"introducedAt":"16.0","name":"tvOS","depre